LICENCE AND COPYRIGHT NOTICE — 1_codebook/ (and 4_evaluation/decp/)

1. DECP
   The code in this folder (train_codebook.py, utils/) and in 4_evaluation/decp/evaluate/ is the official code of
     X. Zhu et al., "Fine-detailed Facial Sketch-to-Photo Synthesis with Detail-enhanced Codebook Priors",
     IEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology, 2025.
     Source: https://github.com/Gardenia-chen/DECP (commit 3e10bc86fa39, 2025-06-03)
   Copyright (c) the DECP authors. All rights reserved.
   The DECP repository does not publish a licence (checked 2026-10-31). The code is included here unchanged except for the
   edits listed in CHANGES.md (paths, device selection, resume, one file-lookup fix), with attribution, solely so that the
   results of our paper can be reproduced. No licence to the DECP code is granted by this repository; all rights remain with
   the DECP authors. Please cite their paper when you use it. The DECP codebook weights in the companion Drive folder
   (WildSketch, CUFSF) are the DECP authors' official releases and are covered by the same notice.

